      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Discovery Bay started in 1964 as a planned community, originally called Riverside and River Lake, on the Byron Tract once used for barley and potatoes.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
